        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modavuj Multiplayer Market Simulator </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a fun business simulation where you build and grow your own market. Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with customer whims, stock shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a vast grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Shelf Management – ​​Don't leave shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/59b2f00207756eeb359cf8b48d7cc7a8.poster.avif?t=1759995018\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/59b2f00207756eeb359cf8b48d7cc7a8.webm?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/59b2f00207756eeb359cf8b48d7cc7a8.mp4?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 Price Setting – Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will be full. But be careful, overdoing it will make you a trending topic on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/305c9b9666839e4359ad5dbe97d3d0b6.poster.avif?t=1759995018\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/305c9b9666839e4359ad5dbe97d3d0b6.webm?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/305c9b9666839e4359ad5dbe97d3d0b6.mp4?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Customer Relations – Clear the queue quickly, and don't let impatient customers start grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Inventory Monitoring – Don't run out of products; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers will leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bbc72fb8e7020e2f6faae348be9695aa.poster.avif?t=1759995018\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bbc72fb8e7020e2f6faae348be9695aa.webm?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bbc72fb8e7020e2f6faae348be9695aa.mp4?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Market Expansion – Progress step by step from a small grocery store to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bcaa4818dde05e18dbac07a94d08ed18.poster.avif?t=1759995018\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bcaa4818dde05e18dbac07a94d08ed18.webm?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877100/extras/bcaa4818dde05e18dbac07a94d08ed18.mp4?t=1759995018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Your Own Strategy – Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, it's your market, it's your decision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean full customer patience. 😂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
